{
  "uid": "triagem-api",
  "title": "Triagem de urgência - API",
  "tags": [
    "triagem",
    "mlops"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Modelo em uso",
      "description": "Versão do modelo carregada pela API (rótulo da métrica triagem_modelo_info). Muda quando a API reinicia com um modelo novo publicado pelo Airflow.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "triagem_modelo_info",
          "legendFormat": "{{versao}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Vazão de /predict por status",
      "description": "Requisições por segundo em POST /predict, separadas pelo código HTTP. 200 é sucesso; 422 é laudo inválido (vazio ou sem conteúdo).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{route=\"/predict\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de erro (4xx e 5xx)",
      "description": "Fração das requisições que terminaram em erro (status 4xx ou 5xx) sobre o total. Sem tráfego, o painel fica vazio.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "erros",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência HTTP de /predict (P50, P95, P99)",
      "description": "Tempo de resposta visto pelo servidor, incluindo validação e serialização. Percentis estimados a partir de histograma (precisão limitada pelos buckets).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/predict\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/predict\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/predict\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência da inferência (P50, P95)",
      "description": "Tempo só da classificação (normalização do texto e modelo), sem a camada HTTP. É a métrica que a otimização com ONNX deve reduzir.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(triagem_inferencia_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(triagem_inferencia_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Predições por nível de urgência",
      "description": "Laudos classificados por segundo em cada nível. Uma mudança brusca na mistura pode indicar mudança nos dados de entrada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (urgencia) (rate(triagem_predicoes_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{urgencia}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Probabilidade de urgência (monitor de drift)",
      "description": "Média e percentis (P50, P90) da probabilidade de 'urgente' atribuída pelo modelo. Sem rótulos em produção, é um sinal indireto: deslocamentos persistentes sugerem mudança nos dados ou no modelo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(triagem_probabilidade_urgente_sum[$__rate_interval]) / rate(triagem_probabilidade_urgente_count[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "média",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(triagem_probabilidade_urgente_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.9, sum by (le) (rate(triagem_probabilidade_urgente_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "P90",
          "refId": "C",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
